<title>NETHERLANDS: Boskalis U.K. unit orders dredger.</title>
<headline>Boskalis U.K. unit orders dredger.</headline>
<dateline>PAPENDRECHT, Netherlands 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dredging group Koninklijke Boskalis Westminster NV said on Friday its UK based Westminister Dredging Company Ltd had placed an order with Dutch shipyard Verolme Shipyard Heusen BV for the construction of a large trailing suction hopper dredger.</p>
<p>&quot;The international dredging market is growing as a result of increasing demand for infrastructural works, which call for the use of big capacity dredgers,&quot; Boskalis said.</p>
<p>The new dredger represents an investment of approximately 160 million guilders, Boskalis said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
